{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40520","headline":"明禁忌 · 苏拯","name":"明禁忌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴阳家有书，卜筑多禁忌。\n土中若有神，穴处何无祟。\n我识先贤意，本诫骄侈地。\n恣欲剏楼台，率情染朱翠。\n四面兴土功，四时妨农事。\n可以没凶灾，四隅通一二。\n一年省修营，万民停困踬。\n动若契於理，福匪神之遗。\n动若越於常，祸乃身之致。\n神在虚无间，土中非神位。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}